  "type": "Album + Mixtape/Street",
  "description": "More Life is the fifth commercial mixtape by Canadian rapper Drake. It was released on March 18, 2017, through Young Money Entertainment, Cash Money Records, and Republic Records. Described and marketed as a playlist, some publications have referred to it as a mixtape. Production of More Life was handled by a variety of record producers, including 40, Frank Dukes, Boi-1da, Murda Beatz, T-Minus, Nineteen85, and Kanye West, among others. An ensemble of guest vocalists also appear, including West, Young Thug, Giggs, Skepta, Quavo, Travis Scott, 2 Chainz, Jorja Smith, Sampha, and PartyNextDoor.",
